        "text": "Excuse me. Is there a post office near here?"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "S2",
        "text": "Yes, there is. Go straight on until you reach the traffic lights. Then turn left into Mill Road."
      },
      {
        "speaker": "S1",
        "text": "Straight on, then left at the lights. Is it far?"
      },
