        "speaker": "S1",
        "text": "Great. And do you know a good place for lunch?"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "S2",
        "text": "There's a lovely café in the park. They make fresh sandwiches, and it's quite cheap."
      },
      {
        "speaker": "S1",
        "text": "Perfect. Thanks very much for your help!"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "S2",
        "text": "No problem. Enjoy your stay!"
